'''Dorgeshuun weapons''' are [[weapon]]s made of bone, used by [[Dorgeshuun]] tribe. Most of them may be purchased from [[Nardok]] in [[Dorgeshuun Mines]] [[Nardok's Bone Weapons]] shop after completing [[The Lost Tribe]] [[quest]].

==Weapons==
*[[Bone dagger]]
*[[Bone spear]]
*[[Bone club]]
*[[Dorgeshuun crossbow]] (uses [[Bone bolts]] as ammo)

